Z||000000||drednot||03-29-2001||08:55 PM||||The rotors on my 85 SE were starting to show severe signs of being warped.  I took them off and went over to the machine shop.  They were dead.  Could not be re-surfaced.  just not enough metal left.  So, I just bought new ones.  WOW!!  $300 total ^&#^%%&%*&^*#!  The most I ever paid for rotors.  What could I do??  What makes them so fricking expensive???  They were not even vented!?!?!?  what's that all about??||||reg||1
