Z||000009||Bob Englert||03-30-2001||06:34 PM||||I usually try to check with CarParts.com, PartsAmerica.com, and Wrenchead.com before I go shopping for common parts like brake and shock stuff.  With the on line info in hand, I have a better sense of what is fair and when I am getting a good deal.<P>Same with tires, check some of the on line tire stores and compare with your local stores (remember to add mounting and balancing charges to the on line prices).<BR><P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>85 SE 4 cyl||||reg||1
